# Dimensional Exile ("Enchant basic land you control", CR 303.4): Bot1's nonbasic Strip Mine and Bot2's basic Island are not
# legal to enchant, its Plains is. "When this Aura enters, exile target creature an opponent controls until this Aura leaves the
# battlefield" (CR 610.3): Bot1's own Featherbrained Filcher is not a legal target, Bot2's Action News Crew is (its Ornithopter
# is the other candidate). When Bot2's Disenchant destroys the Aura on turn 4, the Crew returns to the battlefield under its
# owner's control, a new object.

[Bot1 Deck]
Strip Mine
Mox Pearl x2
Dimensional Exile
Featherbrained Filcher
Plains
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl x2
Action News Crew
Ornithopter
Disenchant
Island x2
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Featherbrained Filcher.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Action News Crew.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Dimensional Exile.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Strip Mine)
! Bot1.Hand.Dimensional Exile.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Dimensional Exile.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Plains)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Featherbrained Filcher)
Bot1.Target(Action News Crew)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Action News Crew
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 4
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Dimensional Exile)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Dimensional Exile
Bot2.Battlefield.Action News Crew.Keywords = Vigilance
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 5
